      "text": "If there are multiple training samples, step 1-4 are repeated for each sample to generate channels and labels. The channels and labels for the training samples are added as comma-separated arguments in step 5. See an example below:\n\nsvchannels train \\  channels_sample1/channels.zarr.zip,channels_sample2/channels.zarr.zip \\  labels_sample1/labels.json.gz,labels_sample2/labels.json.gz \\  -m model.keras\n\n_Note_: For the purpose of CI testing, the same [BAM file] data/test.bam is used for both model training and testing.",
